the page layouts need work. grid is slow to open — i'd rather have a fixed 4 pages per row and fast than responsive and slow. two-page should scale with the window, right now it doesn't. grid is an overview only: no caret, no editing there. but two-page should be fully editable and navigable, like Pages does it. also clicking a scene in the side panel or a character in the cast panel lands the highlight in the wrong place in two-page — in grid it's enough to highlight the right page.